# Battle pacing timing (battle-pace): the whole first Delrich Temple battle on Normal (two R taps: Fast, Fastest, Normal),
# A every 20 frames from the first command to the field. Logs the battle main state (0x020B0010) and the
# speed level; compare with pace_battle_fast.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
watch u32 0x020B0010 main_state
include warp6
watch u32 0x020B8540 speed_level
wait 270
press R 3
wait 5
press R 3
wait 5
press A 3
wait 17
press A 3
wait 17
press A 3
wait 17
